<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>iOi Evaluation Plans</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --tan: #D0C8BB;
    --yellow: #FFC030;
    --blue: #00ABD8;
    --red: #E4101B;
    --purple: #595696;
    --pink: #F7BCCB;
    --orange: #F37D25;
    --brown: #85746E;
    --teal: #009A78;

    --paper: #FBF8F3;
    --panel: #F3EEE5;
    --ink: #2A2521;
    --ink-soft: #5B5450;

    --font: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;
    --radius: 20px;
    --maxw: 1040px;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    * { animation-duration: 0.001ms !important; transition-duration: 0.001ms !important; }
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font);
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  a { color: inherit; }
  :focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--teal);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .wrap { max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

  header.hero {
    background: var(--panel);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42,37,33,0.08);
    padding: 56px 0 48px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--teal);
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.1rem);
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .hero-intro {
    max-width: 62ch;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  main { padding: 48px 0 64px; }

  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .card-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .hub-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 30px 26px;
    min-height: 220px;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .hub-card:hover, .hub-card:focus-visible { transform: translateY(-3px); }

  .hub-card[data-area="YMD"] { background: var(--teal); }
  .hub-card[data-area="POP"] { background: var(--orange); }
  .hub-card[data-area="PFFF"] { background: var(--brown); }
  .hub-card[data-area="BBF"] { background: var(--purple); }

  .hub-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .hub-card p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    opacity: 0.95;
  }
  .hub-card .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    padding: 9px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  footer {
    padding: 40px 0 60px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  footer p {
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">iOi evaluation plans</p>
    <h1>Evaluation Plans</h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">
      Dive into detailed evaluation plans for iOi programmes.
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card-grid">

      <a class="hub-card" data-area="YMD" href="YMitD_evaluation_plan.html">
        <div>
          <h2>Young Makers in the Docks</h2>
          <p>A 4-week co-designed programme with 16 children.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="cta">View evaluation plan</span>
      </a>

      <a class="hub-card" data-area="POP" href="Power_of_Play.html">
        <div>
          <h2>The Power of Play</h2>
          <p>LEGO funded programme in Tower Hamlets and Newham.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="cta">View evaluation plan</span>
      </a>

      <a class="hub-card" data-area="PFFF" href="Playing_for_a_Fairer_Future.html">
        <div>
          <h2>Playing for a Fairer Future</h2>
          <p>National Lottery funded 5-year project in Tower Hamlets, Doncaster and West Belfast.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="cta">View evaluation plan</span>
      </a>

       <a class="hub-card" data-area="BBF" href="Building_brighter_futures.html">
        <div>
          <h2>Building Brighter Futures</h2>
          <p>1 year programme in Tower Hamlets schools.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="cta">View evaluation plan</span>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>This hub links out to iOi's evaluation resources — plans, case studies, and the frameworks behind them.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
